namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamLayoutContainerBorder {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerBorder
    src   "UMG's UBorder: one child, padded, aligned by the BORDER rather than by the child's slot.\n\nThat last part is the only thing here that is not already expressible as an Overlay with a rect-block\nvisual, and it is the reason this is a class. Everywhere else in this plugin alignment belongs to the\nslot -- \"where do I sit in what I was given\" -- and a Border inverts it: the alignment is the\ncontainer's statement about where it puts its content. Authors coming from UMG set HorizontalAlignment\non the Border, and before this that property had nowhere to live.\n\nThe background is the owning widget's own visual, which is how every other drawn thing works here.\nBrushColor tints it, as SBorder multiplies its brush by BorderBackgroundColor, without touching the\nvisual's own colour (UDreamVisual::SetColorMultiplier). There is no Background FSlateBrush: a DreamGUI\nwidget's art comes from its visual (sprite, rect block, image), and adding a second source of it would\nbe a fork of the render path rather than a port of a panel.\n\nWhat SBorder adds on top of its brush is here too: ContentColorAndOpacity tints what the border holds\nand never the background, a disabled border draws its background at the disabled effect's 45% alpha,\nand the background can be mirrored for a right-to-left culture."
    text  "UMG 的 UBorder：一个子项，带填充，由边框（而非子项的槽）决定对齐。\n\n最后这一点是这里唯一无法用带矩形块可视的 Overlay 表达的东西，\n也是它之所以是一个类的原因。在本插件的其他地方，对齐都属于槽——\n“我坐在给我的空间的什么位置”——而边框把它反转过来：对齐是\n容器关于自己把内容放在哪里的声明。从 UMG 过来的作者会在边框上设置 HorizontalAlignment，\n而在此之前这个属性无处安放。\n\n背景是所属控件自己的可视，这也是这里其他所有绘制物的做法。\nBrushColor 给它着色，正如 SBorder 用 BorderBackgroundColor 乘以它的笔刷，而不触碰\n可视自身的颜色（UDreamVisual::SetColorMultiplier）。这里没有 Background FSlateBrush：DreamGUI\n控件的画面来自它的可视（sprite、矩形块、图像），再加第二个来源只会是\n渲染路径的分叉，而不是一个面板的移植。\n\nSBorder 在其笔刷之上额外提供的东西这里也有：ContentColorAndOpacity（内容颜色与不透明度）给边框所容纳的内容\n着色，而绝不给背景着色；禁用的边框以其禁用效果的 45% alpha 绘制背景；\n背景可以为从右到左的文化做镜像。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerBorder:bFlipForRightToLeftFlowDirection {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerBorder:bFlipForRightToLeftFlowDirection
    src   "Mirror the background left to right while this border lays out right to left -- UMG's\nbFlipForRightToLeftFlowDirection, SBorder's render transform of (-1, 1) about the brush's centre. The content is\nnot mirrored by it: where the content sits is the layout's to mirror, and it does."
    text  "当此边框按从右到左布局时，将背景左右镜像——即 UMG 的\nbFlipForRightToLeftFlowDirection，SBorder 围绕笔刷中心施加 (-1, 1) 的渲染变换。内容\n不会随之镜像：内容坐在哪里由布局负责镜像，而布局确实会这样做。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerBorder:BrushColor {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerBorder:BrushColor
    src   "A tint over the background -- the owning widget's visual -- multiplied with the visual's own colour in linear\nspace, as SBorder multiplies its brush by BorderBackgroundColor. White leaves the visual as authored."
    text  "覆盖在背景（所属控件自己的可视）之上的着色，在线性空间中与可视自身的颜色相乘，\n正如 SBorder 用 BorderBackgroundColor 乘以它的笔刷。白色则保持可视原本的样子。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerBorder:bShowEffectWhenDisabled {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerBorder:bShowEffectWhenDisabled
    src   "While the border is disabled (UDreamWidget::GetIsEnabledInHierarchy), draw the background at 45% of its alpha:\nSBorder's disabled draw effect, which the default Slate shader spends as alpha x 0.45. Only the background --\nwhat the border holds shows its own disabled look."
    text  "当边框被禁用时（控件在层级中的启用状态，UDreamWidget::GetIsEnabledInHierarchy），以背景 alpha 的 45% 绘制背景：\n这是 SBorder 的禁用绘制效果，默认 Slate 着色器将其作为 alpha x 0.45 使用。仅背景如此——\n边框所容纳的内容显示自己的禁用外观。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerBorder:ContentColorAndOpacity {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerBorder:ContentColorAndOpacity
    src   "A tint over everything the border holds and never over its own background -- UMG's ContentColorAndOpacity,\nwhich SCompoundWidget blends into what its children inherit. It is the owning widget's content tint\n(UDreamWidget::SetContentTint), so it reaches every visual below the border, alpha included."
    text  "覆盖在边框所容纳的一切之上、而绝不覆盖其自身背景的着色——即 UMG 的 ContentColorAndOpacity（内容颜色与不透明度），\nSCompoundWidget 会把它混合进其子项所继承的内容。它是所属控件的内容着色\n（UDreamWidget::SetContentTint），因此会作用到边框之下的每一个可视，包括 alpha。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerBorder:DesiredSizeScale {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerBorder:DesiredSizeScale
    src   "UMG's UBorder::DesiredSizeScale: scales what this border REPORTS, not what it arranges."
    text  "UMG 的 UBorder::DesiredSizeScale：调整此边框报告的大小，而不是调整其布局。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerBorder:FlipModifier {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerBorder:FlipModifier
    src   "The mirror this border made; weak, the widget owns it."
    text  "此边框创建的镜像；弱引用，由控件持有。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerBorder:HorizontalAlignment {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerBorder:HorizontalAlignment
    src   "Where the border puts its content. Overrides the content slot's own alignment, as UMG's does."
