DreamLayoutContainerGridPanel:ClearFill {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerGridPanel:ClearFill
    src   "Drop every fill coefficient, so every track goes back to sizing itself from its children."
    text  "清除所有填充系数，使每条轨道重新依据其子项确定自身大小。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerGridPanel:SetColumnFillAt {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerGridPanel:SetColumnFillAt
    src   "UMG's UGridPanel::SetColumnFill(Index, Coefficient), under a name that says it addresses one track.\n\nThe plain name is already the whole-array BlueprintSetter for ColumnFill, and two reflected\nfunctions cannot share a name, so the per-track form gets the suffix. The array grows to reach the\nindex, the way UMG's does."
    text  "UMG 的 UGridPanel::SetColumnFill(Index, Coefficient)，换成一个表明它针对单条轨道的名字。\n\n朴素的名字已经是 ColumnFill 整个数组的蓝图 Setter，而两个反射\n函数不能同名，因此逐轨道的形式带上了后缀。数组会增长以到达\n该索引，与 UMG 的行为一致。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor
    src   "UMG's UMenuAnchor, layout side.\n\nThe first child is the anchor -- the button, the combo box face -- and is filled like a Border's\ncontent. An optional second child is the menu: it does NOT contribute to this panel's measured size\n(a menu that grew its own button would be unusable) and is placed against the anchor's rect by\nPlacement, then clamped into the root widget when bFitInWindow is set.\n\nWith no menu authored as the second child, one is built each time the menu opens -- by OnGetMenuContent,\nelse from MenuClass -- and destroyed when it closes, as UMG builds and releases its menu content.\n\nWhere the menu is drawn is bUseApplicationMenuStack's question. Off, it is drawn in place: clipped by\nthe anchor's ancestors and sorted with its siblings, as every saved anchor has always drawn it. On, the\nmenu goes onto its player's popup layer (UDreamUIPopupLayer::Push) for as long as it is open -- above\neverything, dismissed by a press outside it, Back or Tab, following the anchor -- and is placed there by this\npanel's own Placement and bFitInWindow, with the slot it has here (padding, nudge), so it lands where it would in place."
    text  "UMG 的 UMenuAnchor，布局方面。\n\n第一个子项是锚点——按钮、组合框的正面——它像边框的内容一样被填充。\n可选的第二个子项是菜单：它不参与此面板的测量尺寸\n（一个会撑大自己按钮的菜单是无法使用的），而是依据 Placement 相对锚点的矩形放置，\n在设置 bFitInWindow 时再被收进根控件之内。\n\n如果没有作为第二个子项编写的菜单，则每次菜单打开时都会构建一个——通过 OnGetMenuContent，\n否则来自 MenuClass——并在关闭时销毁，正如 UMG 构建和释放其菜单内容。\n\n菜单绘制在哪里是 bUseApplicationMenuStack 的问题。关闭时，它就地在原处绘制：被\n锚点的祖先裁剪，并与其同级一起排序，正如每个已保存的锚点一直以来的绘制方式。开启时，\n菜单在其打开期间被放到其玩家的弹出层（UDreamUIPopupLayer::Push）上——位于一切之上，\n被外部按压、Back 或 Tab 关闭，跟随锚点——并由本面板自己的 Placement 和 bFitInWindow\n以及它在这里的槽（内边距、微调）放置在那里，使其落在就地绘制时会落的位置。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:bFitInWindow {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:bFitInWindow
    src   "Keep the placed menu inside the root widget's rect, shifting it rather than letting it overhang."
    text  "使放置的菜单保持在根控件的矩形内，通过平移而非任其超出。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:bUseApplicationMenuStack {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:bUseApplicationMenuStack
    src   "Open the menu on its player's popup layer rather than in place -- UMG's UseApplicationMenuStack. The menu is\nlifted onto the player's screen root while it is open, so no ancestor clips it; a press outside it, Back, or its\nanchor going away closes it (and bIsOpen with it); and it follows the anchor, placed by Placement and\nbFitInWindow. Off by default, where UMG's is on, so an anchor saved before this existed keeps drawing in place."
    text  "在所属玩家的弹出层上打开菜单，而不是就地打开——即 UMG 的 UseApplicationMenuStack。菜单\n打开期间会被提升到玩家的屏幕根节点上，因此不会被任何祖先裁剪；在其外部按下、按 Back，或它的\n锚点消失都会将其关闭（bIsOpen 也随之关闭）；并且它会跟随锚点，由 Placement 和\nbFitInWindow 放置。默认关闭，而 UMG 中该项默认开启，这样在此功能出现之前保存的锚点仍保持就地绘制。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:GetAnchorContent {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:GetAnchorContent
    src   "The first child: the thing the menu is anchored to. Null when the panel is empty."
    text  "第一个子项：菜单所锚定的对象。面板为空时为空。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:GetMenuContent {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:GetMenuContent
    src   "The menu: the second child, authored or built -- or, while it is lifted onto the popup layer, the lifted widget,\nwhich is then nobody's child here. Null when this anchor has no menu."
    text  "菜单：第二个子项，由作者指定或构建生成——或者，当它被提升到弹出层上时，为被提升的控件，\n此时它在这里不再是任何对象的子项。此锚点没有菜单时为空。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:MenuClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:MenuClass
    src   "A user widget made each time the menu opens and destroyed when it closes -- UMG's MenuClass. Used when no menu is\nauthored as the second child and OnGetMenuContent answers nothing."
    text  "每次菜单打开时创建、关闭时销毁的用户控件——即 UMG 的 MenuClass。用于没有将菜单\n编写为第二个子项且 OnGetMenuContent 不返回任何内容时。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:OnGetMenuContent {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:OnGetMenuContent
    src   "Asked for the menu each time it opens, ahead of MenuClass -- UMG's OnGetUserMenuContentEvent. What it hands back\nis put under this anchor as its menu and is the anchor's from then on: destroyed when the menu closes, as UMG\nreleases the content it was given. Hand a fresh widget each time. Ignored while a menu is authored as the\nsecond child."
    text  "每次菜单打开时先于 MenuClass 请求菜单——即 UMG 的 OnGetUserMenuContentEvent。它返回的内容\n会作为菜单放在此锚点下，并从此归该锚点所有：菜单关闭时销毁，如同 UMG\n释放它所收到的内容一样。每次都应提供一个全新的控件。当菜单已由作者指定为\n第二个子项时忽略。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:SetIsOpen {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:SetIsOpen
    src   "Show or hide the menu. Closed, it is collapsed, so it costs no layout and no hit test. Opening builds the menu\nwhen none is authored, and pushes it onto the popup layer under bUseApplicationMenuStack."
    text  "显示或隐藏菜单。关闭时它会折叠，因此不占用布局，也不参与命中测试。打开时，若没有\n作者指定的菜单则构建菜单，并在 bUseApplicationMenuStack 下将其推送到弹出层。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:SetMenuClass {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:SetMenuClass
    src   "Closes a menu that was built from the old class first."
    text  "会先关闭用旧类构建的菜单。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:SetUseApplicationMenuStack {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerMenuAnchor:SetUseApplicationMenuStack
