DreamLayoutContainerSafeZone:SafeAreaScale {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerSafeZone:SafeAreaScale
    src   "Per-side multiplier over the padding the PLATFORM reports, matching SSafeZone's SafeAreaScale:\none is the whole reported inset, zero ignores that side entirely. SafePadding is added on top of\nthe scaled result and is not touched by it, as in Slate.\n\nThe four bPad* switches are the same idea at its extremes; this is the dial between them, for the\nphone whose reported bottom inset is a gesture bar you only want to half-clear."
    text  "在平台报告的填充之上按侧应用的乘数，与 SSafeZone 的 SafeAreaScale 对应：\n1 表示使用报告的全部内边距，0 表示完全忽略该侧。SafePadding 会加在\n缩放后的结果之上，且不受其影响，与 Slate 中一致。\n\n四个 bPad* 开关是同一思路的两端极端；而这正是它们之间的调节旋钮，适用于\n报告底部内边距为手势条、而你只想半幅避让的手机。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerSafeZone:SetSidesToPad {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerSafeZone:SetSidesToPad
    src   "USafeZone::SetSidesToPad: the four side switches in one call, in UMG's argument order\n(left, right, top, bottom -- not the order an FMargin lists them in)."
    text  "USafeZone::SetSidesToPad：一次调用设置四个侧边开关，参数顺序与 UMG 相同\n（左、右、上、下——而非 FMargin 列出它们的顺序）。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScaleBox:bIgnoreInheritedScale {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScaleBox:bIgnoreInheritedScale
    src   "Divide whatever scale the stretch mode arrived at by the scale this box inherits from above, so the content is\ndrawn at that scale on screen. Every mode, as SScaleBox divides them all -- and measured exactly as it is\narranged, so the box asks its parent for the room its content will actually take."
    text  "将拉伸模式得出的缩放除以此框从上层继承的缩放，使内容\n在屏幕上按该缩放绘制。所有模式皆如此，因为 SScaleBox 会对它们统一做除法——并按实际排列方式精确测量，\n因此该框向父级请求其内容实际要占用的空间。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScaleBox:GetSafeZoneScale {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScaleBox:GetSafeZoneScale
    src   "The scale ScaleBySafeZone draws at right now: 1 under any other stretch, and wherever there is no game viewport to ask."
    text  "ScaleBySafeZone 当前绘制所用的缩放值：在其他任何拉伸模式下，以及在没有可查询的游戏视口的地方，均为 1。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScaleBox:Stretch {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScaleBox:Stretch
    src   "How the content is scaled. ScaleToFitX, ScaleToFitY, ScaleToFill and UserSpecifiedWithClipping clip it to the box\nwhile the widget's own Clipping is left at Inherit, as SScaleBox's paint does."
    text  "内容的缩放方式。ScaleToFitX、ScaleToFitY、ScaleToFill 和 UserSpecifiedWithClipping 会将内容裁剪到框内，\n同时控件自身的裁剪保持为 Inherit，与 SScaleBox 的绘制行为一致。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScaleBox:StretchDirection {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScaleBox:StretchDirection
    src   "Which way the box is allowed to scale, matching Slate's EStretchDirection. DownOnly is the one\nthat gets used: art authored at its intended size should shrink to fit a small screen and never\nbe blown up past it, which is a rule the Stretch modes cannot state on their own."
    text  "该框允许的缩放方向，对应 Slate 的 EStretchDirection。DownOnly 是实际使用的那个：\n按目标尺寸制作的美术资源应缩小以适应小屏幕，绝不应被放大超出该尺寸，\n这条规则是各拉伸模式本身无法表达的。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:AnalogMouseWheelKey {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:AnalogMouseWheelKey
    src   "The analog key that acts as this box's mouse wheel -- UMG's AnalogMouseWheelKey. Invalid (the\ndefault) means \"whatever the input preset already routes here\", which is the right stick and\ntherefore exactly today's behaviour."
    text  "充当此框鼠标滚轮的模拟按键——即 UMG 的 AnalogMouseWheelKey。Invalid（默认值）表示“输入预设已路由到此处的按键”，\n也就是右摇杆，\n因此与当前行为完全一致。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:bAllowOverscroll {
