DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:bAllowRightClickDragScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:bAllowRightClickDragScrolling
    src   "Whether a drag with the RIGHT button scrolls this box -- UMG's bAllowRightClickDragScrolling, on by default as\nthere. Off leaves the right button to whatever wants it for a context menu. On, a right drag is still refused\nwhile there is nothing to scroll, as SScrollBox refuses it unless its bar IsNeeded. A left-button drag scrolls\nwhatever this says: it is this library's own gesture, and existing screens rely on it."
    text  "用右键拖动是否滚动此框——即 UMG 的 bAllowRightClickDragScrolling，与那里一样默认开启。关闭时，右键留给需要它打开上下文菜单的地方。开启时，\n在没有可滚动内容时仍会拒绝右键拖动，正如 SScrollBox 除非其滚动条 IsNeeded 否则也会拒绝一样。无论此项如何，左键拖动始终会滚动：\n这是本库自带的手势，\n现有界面依赖它。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:bAnimateWheelScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:bAnimateWheelScrolling
    src   "Ease to the wheel's new position over a few frames instead of jumping there."
    text  "在若干帧内缓动到滚轮的新位置，而不是直接跳转过去。"
