}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:bBackPadScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:bBackPadScrolling
    src   "A whole viewport of empty space BEFORE the content -- UMG's BackPadScrolling: at offset zero the first child sits\none viewport in, so the first item can be scrolled all the way to the far edge. A viewport rather than half of\none, which is Slate's arithmetic (SScrollPanel's ScrollPadding is the panel's own length). It adds to the scroll\nrange and takes nothing from what a Fill slot is given."
    text  "内容之前的整屏空白——即 UMG 的 BackPadScrolling：在偏移量为零时，第一个子项向内偏移一整屏，\n因此第一个项目可以一直滚动到远端边缘。是一整屏而不是半屏，\n后者是 Slate 的算法（SScrollPanel 的 ScrollPadding 是面板自身的长度）。\n它会增加滚动范围，且不会占用填充槽位所获得的空间。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:bEnableInertia {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:bEnableInertia
    src   "Keep moving under momentum after the finger or mouse lets go."
    text  "手指或鼠标松开后，内容依靠惯性继续移动。"
