DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:ConsumeMouseWheel {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:ConsumeMouseWheel
    src   "Whether the wheel is swallowed here or handed to an outer scroll box once this one is at a limit."
    text  "当此框已到极限时，滚轮是由此框吞下还是交给外层滚动框。"
