}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:DecelerationRate {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:DecelerationRate
    src   "How quickly momentum dies. 0 never slows down; larger values stop sooner. Same units and\ndefault as the legacy scroll view, so a value tuned there carries over."
    text  "动量消失的快慢。0表示永不减速；数值越大停得越早。单位与默认值与\n旧版滚动视图相同，因此在旧版中调好的值可直接沿用。"
