}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:EndInertialScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:EndInertialScrolling
    src   "Drop the fling, keeping the position and whatever rubber band is open -- UMG's name for it."
    text  "结束惯性滑动，保持位置以及当前打开的橡皮筋效果——沿用UMG的命名。"
