DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:GetAnimatedScrollTarget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:GetAnimatedScrollTarget
    src   "Where an eased scroll is heading; the current offset when nothing is animating."
