DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:GetScrollOffset {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:GetScrollOffset
    src   "Distance scrolled from the start, in local units. Always within [0, GetMaxScrollOffset()]."
    text  "从起点起已滚动的距离，使用局部单位。始终位于[0, GetMaxScrollOffset()]范围内。"
