DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:GetScrollOffsetOfEnd {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:GetScrollOffsetOfEnd
    src   "The offset at which the end of the content is in view -- UMG's name for GetMaxScrollOffset."
