}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:IsAnimatingScroll {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:IsAnimatingScroll
    src   "True while an eased scroll is still running."
    text  "缓动滚动仍在进行时为 true。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:IsScrollGestureMirrored {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:IsScrollGestureMirrored
    src   "True when a GESTURE on this box has to be read backwards -- a horizontal box in a right-to-left\nlayout, and nothing else.\n\nThe offset itself needs no flipping, and that is worth spelling out because it looks like it\nshould: the arrangement walks the children in content space and subtracts the offset there, and\nCommitChildRect reflects the finished rect afterwards. So offset still means \"how far from the\ncontent's START edge\", the start edge is simply the right one now, and a larger offset still\nreveals later items. Overscroll rides the same arithmetic and follows for free.\n\nWhat does NOT follow is the pointer: a drag delta and a wheel axis arrive in the panel's own\nspace and are never reflected, so without this the content would run away from the finger in a\nmirrored layout. One sign, in the one place gestures become offsets."
    text  "当此框上的手势必须反向解读时为 true——\n即从右到左布局中的水平框，仅此而已。\n\n偏移量本身无需翻转，这一点值得说明，因为看上去似乎应该翻转：排列会\n在内容空间中遍历子项并在那里减去偏移量，而 CommitChildRect 随后反映最终矩形。\n因此偏移量仍表示“距内容的起始边缘的距离”，只是起始边缘现在是右边缘，\n较大的偏移量仍然会显示靠后的项。\n越界回弹沿用同一套运算，因而自动跟随。\n\n不跟随的是指针：拖动增量和滚轮轴以面板自身的空间到达，\n并且从不做镜像，所以没有这一项时，内容会在镜像布局中从手指下跑开。\n一个符号的翻转，就落在手势变为偏移量的唯一一处。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:IsScrolling {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:IsScrolling
    src   "True while momentum or a spring-back is still moving the content."
    text  "惯性或回弹仍在带动内容时为 true。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:IsScrollNeeded {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:IsScrollNeeded
    src   "Whether there is anything to scroll: content longer than the viewport, as the last layout pass measured it --\nSScrollBar's IsNeeded. False before the first pass, which has measured nothing yet."
    text  "是否有可滚动的内容：内容比视口更长，以最后一次布局计算的结果为准——\n即 SScrollBar 的 IsNeeded。首次布局计算之前为 false，此时尚未测量任何内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:NavigationDestination {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:NavigationDestination
