DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:NavigationScrollPadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:NavigationScrollPadding
    src   "How much of the window to keep clear around a revealed widget, in local units -- UMG's\nNavigationScrollPadding. Stops a row landing flush against the edge with its neighbour cut in\nhalf beside it, which is the only cue a player has that the list continues."
    text  "在被显示的控件周围要留出多少窗口空间作为填充，以本地单位计——即 UMG 的\nNavigationScrollPadding。可避免某一行紧贴边缘、相邻项在旁边被裁掉一半，\n而那正是玩家判断列表仍有后续的唯一线索。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:OverscrollLimit {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:OverscrollLimit
    src   "How far past an end the content can be pulled, in local units. The pull saturates towards this\nrather than stopping at it, so the resistance grows the further out you drag and the content\ncan never be dragged away indefinitely -- which the legacy view's flat damping allowed."
    text  "内容可越过端点被拉动的距离，以本地单位计。拉动会趋于该值而非在该值处停止，\n因此拖得越远阻力越大，\n内容永远不会被无限拖走——旧版视图的均匀阻尼则允许这种情况。"
    state machine
}

