DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:ScrollOffset {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:ScrollOffset
    src   "Distance scrolled from the start. Editable so the designer can scroll the content in the prefab\neditor (where no pointer input exists) to reach and edit off-screen children; the authored value\nis also the initial scroll position at runtime. Clamped to [0, GetMaxScrollOffset()] by layout."
    text  "距起始位置已滚动的距离。可编辑，以便设计师在预制体编辑器中（此处没有指针\n输入）滚动内容，够到并编辑屏幕外的子项；所设置的值\n也是运行时的初始滚动位置。布局时会钳制到 [0, GetMaxScrollOffset()]。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:ScrollSensitivity {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:ScrollSensitivity
    src   "Local units scrolled per wheel notch.\n\nBlueprintSetter, like every writable knob below it: a plain Blueprint write onto the variable\nskips whatever the setter does about it, and on this box several of these have to re-measure,\nre-sync the bar or re-arm the physics before the number means anything."
    text  "每个滚轮刻度滚动的本地单位数。\n\nBlueprintSetter，与下面每个可写开关一样：直接向变量进行蓝图写入\n会跳过设置器对此所做的处理，而在本框上，其中若干项必须先重新测量、\n重新同步滚动条或重新准备物理，数值才有意义。"
    state machine
}

