DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:ScrollWidgetIntoView {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:ScrollWidgetIntoView
    src   "Scroll the minimum distance that brings InWidget into view. Accepts any descendant, not just a\ndirect child. Returns false when the widget is not inside this box or nothing needed to move.\nEased by default, as UMG's is -- a jump loses the reader's place on a long list.\n\n@param InDestination Where the widget ends up. Configured (the default) leaves it to this box's\n                     own NavigationDestination, which is what every caller meant before the\n                     parameter existed.\n@param InPadding     How much of the window to keep clear around it. Negative leaves it to this\n                     box's NavigationScrollPadding, for the same reason."
    text  "滚动使 InWidget 进入视图所需的最小距离。接受任意后代，而不只是\n直接子级。当控件不在此框内或无需移动时返回 false。\n默认带缓动，与 UMG 一致——跳转会让读者在长列表中失去位置。\n\n@param InDestination 控件最终到达的位置。Configured（默认值）会将其交给此框\n                     自身的 NavigationDestination，这也是参数存在之前\n                     每个调用者的本意。\n@param InPadding     在其周围保持清空的填充大小。负值会将其交给此框\n                     的 NavigationScrollPadding，原因相同。"
    state machine
}

