DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:TickScrollPhysics {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:TickScrollPhysics
    src   "Advance momentum and spring-back by DeltaTime. Deliberately free of input plumbing: the physics\ncan then be stepped directly by a test, which is the only way any of this gets verified without\na real pointer."
    text  "按DeltaTime推进动量和回弹。刻意不依赖输入管线：这样物理\n就可以由测试直接步进，而这是在没有\n真实指针的情况下验证这一切的唯一方式。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:WheelScrollMultiplier {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerScrollBox:WheelScrollMultiplier
    src   "A plain multiplier on whatever one wheel notch already travels -- UMG's WheelScrollMultiplier.\nScrollSensitivity is the distance; this scales it, so \"the same feel, twice as fast\" is one\nnumber and not a re-tuned one."
    text  "对一格滚轮已经滚动的距离施加的纯倍率——即UMG的WheelScrollMultiplier。\nScrollSensitivity是距离，这里对它进行缩放，因此“相同手感、两倍速度”只是一个\n数字，而不是重新调过的另一个数字。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerSizeBox:ClearWidthOverride {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerSizeBox:ClearWidthOverride
    src   "USizeBox's per-axis accessors. The two bounds are stored as one FVector2D apiece here, which is\nthe same four numbers with half the fields; these name the axis the way UMG does, and Clear is\n\"put that axis back to zero\", which is how this class already spells \"no opinion\"."
    text  "USizeBox的按轴访问器。这里两个边界各自存为一个FVector2D，也就是\n同样的四个数字、一半的字段；这些访问器按UMG的方式命名轴，而Clear的意思是\n“把该轴恢复为零”，这正是此类已有的“不作表态”写法。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerSizeBox:MinAspectRatio {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerSizeBox:MinAspectRatio
    src   "Width-over-height bounds on the CONTENT's rect, as SBox applies them: the box itself is sized by\nthe rules above, and a content rect whose ratio falls outside these is shrunk on one axis until it\ndoes not, then re-aligned inside the space it was offered.\n\nZero means \"not set\", which is the convention MinDesiredSize and MaxDesiredSize already use here;\nUMG spends a separate bOverride_ bit on each instead. A pair that crosses resolves to the maximum,\nbecause the maximum is tested first, and a content rect with a zero side is left alone -- there is\nno ratio to correct."
    text  "CONTENT 矩形上的宽高比边界，与 SBox 的应用方式相同：盒子本身按上述规则确定尺寸，\n宽高比超出此范围的内容矩形会在一轴上收缩直至符合，\n然后在提供给它的空间内重新对齐。\n\n零表示“未设置”，这也是 MinDesiredSize 和 MaxDesiredSize 在此已有的约定；\nUMG 改为在每个上各花一个单独的 bOverride_ 重载位。交叉的一对解析为最大值，\n因为先测试最大值；而有一边为零的内容矩形则原样保留——\n没有比例需要修正。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerUniformGridPanel:SlotPadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerUniformGridPanel:SlotPadding
    src   "UMG's SlotPadding: breathing room INSIDE every cell, around whatever that cell holds, and part of\nhow big a cell has to be. Spacing next to it is the gap BETWEEN cells and no part of a cell -- the\ntwo look alike on screen and differ the moment a cell has a background."
    text  "UMG 的 SlotPadding（插槽填充）：每个单元格内部、围绕该单元格所容纳内容的填充空隙，也是\n单元格大小的一部分。旁边的 Spacing 是单元格之间的间隙，不属于单元格——两者\n在屏幕上看起来相似，但单元格一旦有了背景就立刻不同。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerWidgetSwitcher:GetNumWidgets {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerWidgetSwitcher:GetNumWidgets
    src   "How many pages this switcher has. UMG names it for the panel rather than for the children because\nthat is what a switcher's children are; it answers the same number GetChildrenCount does."
    text  "此切换器有多少页。UMG以面板而不是子项来命名它，因为\n切换器的子项就是页；它返回的数字与GetChildrenCount相同。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerWidgetSwitcher:SetActiveWidget {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerWidgetSwitcher:SetActiveWidget
    src   "UMG's UWidgetSwitcher::SetActiveWidget: show a page by identity rather than by position.\n\nThe index stays the single source of truth (GetActiveWidget resolves through it), so this is a\nlookup followed by SetActiveWidgetIndex. Anything that is not a child of this panel is ignored:\nsilently switching to page 0 is the failure mode that made the index setter clamp in the first\nplace. Returns whether the widget was found."
    text  "UMG的UWidgetSwitcher::SetActiveWidget：按标识而不是按位置显示某一页。\n\n索引仍是唯一依据（GetActiveWidget通过它解析），所以这里是先\n查找、再调用SetActiveWidgetIndex。任何不是此面板子项的内容都会被忽略：\n静默切换到第0页正是当初让索引设置器做钳制的失败模式。\n返回是否找到了该控件。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerWrapBox:GetInnerSlotPadding {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerWrapBox:GetInnerSlotPadding
    src   "UMG's UWrapBox::InnerSlotPadding, which is this panel's Spacing: the gap it leaves between slots."
    text  "UMG的UWrapBox::InnerSlotPadding（填充），即此面板的Spacing：它在插槽之间留下的间隙。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerWrapBox:HorizontalAlignment {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerWrapBox:HorizontalAlignment
    src   "Where a line that did not fill the wrap width sits inside it. UMG enables this for a horizontal\nbox only, and so does this: in a vertical box the lines are columns and there is no horizontal\nline length for the value to describe.\n\nFill stretches every slot of a line by one factor so that the line spans the box: SWrapBox's\nHAlign_Fill, which scales each slot by (allotted width - gaps) / (line length - gaps) and leaves the\ngaps as they are. The target is the box's own width less its padding, not WrapSize, because Slate's\nis the allotted geometry. What the box measures does not change."
    text  "未填满换行宽度的一行在其中所处的位置。UMG仅为水平\n框启用此项，这里也一样：在垂直框中行是列，没有可供该值描述的\n水平行长度。\n\nFill会按一个系数拉伸一行的每个插槽，使该行横跨整个框：即SWrapBox的\nHAlign_Fill，它按（分配宽度 - 间隙）/（行长度 - 间隙）缩放每个插槽，并保持\n间隙不变。目标是框自身的宽度减去其填充，而不是WrapSize，因为在Slate中后者\n是分配到的几何体。框所测量的内容不会改变。"
    state machine
}

DreamLayoutContainerWrapBox:Orientation {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamLayoutContainerWrapBox:Orientation
    src   "Which way the lines run. Horizontal fills a row and wraps downwards -- the classic wrap box, and\nwhat this panel has always done; Vertical fills a column and wraps to the right.\n\nEverything else in the panel is stated in terms of the line's own axis: WrapSize is the length of\na line whichever way it runs, and Spacing's x is the gap ALONG a line with y the gap between them,\nso a horizontal box keeps exactly the meaning it had."
    text  "行的走向。Horizontal按行填充并向下换行——经典的换行盒，也是\n此面板一贯的行为；Vertical按列填充并向右换行。\n\n面板中的其他一切均以行自身的轴向来表述：WrapSize是行的\n长度，无论行朝哪个方向；Spacing的x是沿行方向的间隙，y是\n行与行之间的间隙，因此水平盒保持的正是它原本的含义。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelLayoutBase:AddChild {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamPanelLayoutBase:AddChild
    src   "Returns the child's slot, or null -- see UDreamWidget::AddChild for what null can mean."
    text  "返回子项的插槽，或null——null可能意味着什么，请参阅UDreamWidget控件上的AddChild。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelLayoutBase:DestroyAllChildren {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamPanelLayoutBase:DestroyAllChildren
    src   "UMG's ClearChildren under the name this plugin already gave it: UMG merely detaches and lets GC\ntake the pieces, which here would leave live registered widgets with nobody holding them."
    text  "UMG的ClearChildren，沿用本插件早先给它起的名字：UMG只是将子项分离，让GC\n去收拾残局，而在这里这会让仍在注册中的控件保持活动却无人持有。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelLayoutBase:GetChildrenCount {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamPanelLayoutBase:GetChildrenCount
    src   "UMG's UPanelWidget child API, forwarded to the widget that owns this container.\n\nThe hierarchy here belongs to UDreamWidget and not to the panel -- a widget can take children with\nno container at all -- so these are deliberately forwarders and not a second list. What they buy is\nthat a Blueprint holding the container (which is what GetLayoutContainer hands back, and what a\nvariable typed to a specific panel holds) can ask the questions UMG lets you ask a panel, without\nfirst having to know to hop back to the widget. Every panel gets the same set from here, so no\npanel can grow its own dialect of it."
    text  "UMG的UPanelWidget子项API，转发给拥有此容器的控件。\n\n这里的层级属于UDreamWidget而不是面板——控件完全可以在没有容器的情况下\n接收子项——所以这些有意做成转发器，而不是第二份列表。它们带来的好处是：\n持有该容器的蓝图（GetLayoutContainer返回的正是它，类型为某个具体面板的\n变量持有的也是它）可以提出UMG允许你对面板提出的那些问题，而不必\n先知道要跳回控件。每个面板都从这里获得同一套接口，因此没有哪个\n面板能长出自己的一套方言。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelLayoutBase:ReplaceChildAt {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamPanelLayoutBase:ReplaceChildAt
    src   "UOverlay::ReplaceOverlayChildAt and UStackBox::ReplaceStackBoxChildAt, once, for every panel.\n\nThe widget that was there is detached and left alive -- RemoveChild's contract, so the caller owns\nit afterwards and can put it somewhere or destroy it. The replacement lands at the same index, so\nsibling order (and with it paint order, for the panels that use it) is unchanged."
    text  "UOverlay::ReplaceOverlayChildAt与UStackBox::ReplaceStackBoxChildAt，每个面板各一次。\n\n原先在那里的控件被分离并保持存活——这是RemoveChild的约定，因此之后由调用方\n持有它，可以把它放到别处或销毁。替换者落在同一索引上，所以\n同级顺序（以及随之而来的、对使用它的面板而言的绘制顺序）保持不变。"
    state machine
}

DreamPanelMenuAnchorGetContent__DelegateSignature {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#DreamPanelMenuAnchorGetContent__DelegateSignature
    src   "Builds a panel menu anchor's menu each time it opens -- UMG's OnGetUserMenuContentEvent. Single-cast, as UMG's is:\ntwo handlers would both build a menu and only one of them could be shown."
