}

EDreamScaleBoxStretch.ScaleBySafeZone {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#EDreamScaleBoxStretch:ScaleBySafeZone
    src   "One uniform scale taken from the platform's safe zone: 1 - max(max(Left, Right) / Width, max(Top, Bottom) /\nHeight) of the game viewport, so content laid out for the whole screen shrinks until it clears the margin on\nits tighter side. See UDreamLayoutContainerScaleBox::ComputeSafeZoneScale."
    text  "取自平台安全区的单一等比缩放：游戏视口的1 - max(max(Left, Right) / Width, max(Top, Bottom) /\nHeight)，因此为整个屏幕布局的内容会收缩，直到它在较紧的一侧\n让开边距。参见UDreamLayoutContainerScaleBox::ComputeSafeZoneScale。"
    state machine
}

