EDreamScrollAnimationMode.EaseCurve {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#EDreamScrollAnimationMode:EaseCurve
    src   "An DreamTween easing curve evaluated over a fixed duration, so the scroll always arrives on time\nwhatever the distance. Overshooting curves (Back, Elastic, Bounce) are available, but note the\noffset still clamps to the scrollable range, so an overshoot at either END is flattened."
    text  "在固定时长上求值的DreamTween缓动曲线，因此无论距离多远，滚动总会按时到达。\n可以使用过冲曲线（Back、Elastic、Bounce），但要注意偏移量仍会被限制在可滚动范围内，\n所以任一端的过冲都会被压平。"
    state machine
}

EDreamScrollAnimationMode.InterpToSpeed {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#EDreamScrollAnimationMode:InterpToSpeed
    src   "UMG's own: FInterpTo towards the target at a fixed speed. Never overshoots and has no fixed\narrival time -- a longer distance simply takes longer."
    text  "UMG自带的：以固定速度向目标FInterpTo。从不过冲，也没有固定的\n到达时间——距离越长耗时就越长。"
    state machine
}

