EDreamScrollBoxScrollbarVisibility.Hidden {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/Components/DreamPanelLayouts.h#EDreamScrollBoxScrollbarVisibility:Hidden
    src   "Never shown, though the content still scrolls by wheel, drag and code -- UMG's ScrollBarVisibility set to Hidden.\nA bar that takes room beside the content (UDreamScrollBox's) keeps that room while there is something to scroll,\nas a Hidden Slate bar keeps its slot, and gives it back when there is not."
    text  "从不显示，但内容仍可通过滚轮、拖动和代码滚动——即UMG的ScrollBarVisibility，其可视性设为Hidden。\n在内容旁占位的滚动条（UDreamScrollBox的）在有内容可滚动时保留该空间，\n正如Hidden的Slate滚动条保留其插槽，无可滚动内容时再归还该空间。"
